    "tacticsCard": "This is a rhythm kiter: it dances in and out around the cone's cooldown, closing to roughly two and a half meters when the close-range cone is up to land the burst and knockback, then backing off to six or seven meters while it recharges, spamming the disc at anything within thirteen meters with a slight lead on the target's movement. It holds the shield/cleanse for burns, for a telegraphed incoming cast inside seven meters, or when someone gets within five meters while it's unshielded, and it walks straight out of enemy zones before anything else.",
